# Normalize line endings. The dev box is Windows and CI runs Linux, so
# without this every file round-trips as CRLF in the index and diffs are
# noise. Text is stored LF in the repo and checked out per-platform.
* text=auto

# Fixture decks and any other package payloads are binary. A .pptx is a zip;
# CRLF translation would corrupt one silently.
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
